name=HARMONIE - Home Medic
id=HARMONIE_HomeMedic
description=A complete health overhaul for Build 42, all in one mod: Extensive Health Rework Evolved B42 (Workshop 3726328119) and The Only Cure (Workshop 3580276809, by ZioPao, github.com/ZioPao/The-Only-Cure) merged in with their authors' permission -- blood volume, diseases, wounds, medication, surgery, amputation and prostheses. Adds traditional/folk medicine items, blood loss you can feel (stamina ceiling and darkening vision that throbs with your heartbeat), The Only Cure surgery options inside the medical window (also when treating another player) a per-player delirium sound volume / mute, and a full surgery system: 10 operations (debridement, abscess drainage, foreign body, parasite, thoracic, organ salvage, neurosurgery, blood purification, amputation, experimental Knox) built from 15 reusable procedure minigames (a real operative field: drape, prepped skin, tissue, blood, the instrument in your hand, a patient monitor and sounds) with a pre-op checklist; advanced diseases need surgery once medicine has halted them, and illnesses stay Unknown until you diagnose them by their signs in the Diagnosis tab. One medical window with six tabs (monitor, immunity, body stats incl. other mods' stats, diagnosis, disease handbook, surgery) that can be pinned or folded like the inventory, in one blue theme shared by every window of the mod. English and Thai built in. Replaces both mods: do NOT enable Extensive Health Rework Evolved or The Only Cure together with this mod (existing saves keep their health and amputation data).
